Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 10:52:10 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] DAST follow-ups: XML-safe document rendering, header-only
 cron secret, ignore storage/

OWASP ZAP authenticated active scan (~70k requests) found 0 high/medium. It surfaced a 500 in
POST /tailor (control characters crash python-docx, which also hits real-world PDF text) and the
cron secret being accepted in the query string; both fixed, with regression tests. Also adds
backend/storage/ (uploaded CVs) to .gitignore: it was missing, and pushes use git add -A on a
public repo (history checked: nothing was ever committed). Audit doc updated with the DAST and
access-control matrix results.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
